High Priest Palatine      Managgen         2    90   Josh the gentle   4    80
Arch-Mage Palatine        Herlen          20    40   Managgen        20    40
King of Pain              Josh the gentle  1   338   None
Praetorian Guard          435th Dwf Lt Cav  1   110   None
  As the Praetorian Guard, the 435th Light Cavalry has won recognition as 
the land unit most qualified to protect the future World Emperor.  Whenever 
they encamp with other armies, they spend their time telling stories of the 
great battles they have fought.  Their gallantry inspires their fellow 
soldiers to train more intensively, so that when the 435th Light Cavalry 
trains other land units, their chance to improve in quality is doubled, and 
the chance for non-land units is increased by half.


  The Evil alignment now controls 13% of the world's votes
(taxbase + (5 X office/treasure points)).     


